  "descriptions": {
    "non_structured": "Punchy, breathless efforts. Find a steep 3-5 minute hill and do several very hard repeats, or attack aggressively on short inclines during a session. Easy spinning otherwise.",
    "structured": "Warm up for 10 mins. Main Block: Up to 3 blocks of 8-15x (40s on @ 110% FTP / 20s off). Rest 5m between blocks. Cool down for 10 mins. Remaining time (if any) is Z2 endurance.",
    "mix": "Option 1 (Structured):\nWarm up for 10 mins. Main Block: Up to 3 blocks of 8-15x (40s on @ 110% FTP / 20s off). Rest 5m between blocks. Cool down for 10 mins. Remaining time (if any) is Z2 endurance.\n\nOption 2 (Unstructured):\nPunchy, breathless efforts. Find a steep 3-5 minute hill and do several very hard repeats, or attack aggressively on short inclines during a session. Easy spinning otherwise."
